1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,747
Dissolve potassium ferrocyanide.

2
00:00:02,747 --> 00:00:05,221
Only the potassium ions leave.

3
00:00:05,221 --> 00:00:13,606
The ferrocyanide complex ion stays in one piece, so the solution gives no test for ferrous ion or cyanide.

4
00:00:13,606 --> 00:00:16,627
A double salt exists only as a solid.

5
00:00:16,627 --> 00:00:20,911
A complex salt keeps its complex ion in solution.

